  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Selective Admixture, Destruction sphere (Admixture, Selective Blast), any one Admixture feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use destructive blast, you may choose to have the effect of any Admixture on the blast affect you rather than or in addition to affecting damaged creatures or those omitted from damage by Selective Blast.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/destruction#toc143\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
